## 4. The Level — Lightless Caverns

One long, escalating level. Direction reframed by mirrored gravity — up and down
are both "ground," so the journey may be **horizontal traversal** rather than a
pure descent. _(draft structure)_
- **Act 1 — Teach:** introduce opposite-gravity movement + first co-op verbs in safe space.
- **Act 2 — Test:** shadow creatures + path-clearing puzzles; players increasingly separated across the divide.
- **Act 3 — Twist:** hardest cooperation; (if toggleable) gravity-flipping enters; mystery deepens.
- **Climax / ending:** _(TBD — mystery payoff?)_

- [ ] Confirm overall direction (horizontal vs. descent vs. both)
- [ ] Checkpoint cadence · approx length (see Gaps)

