## 7. Art & Audio Direction

Direction set by tone (**eerie**) + setting (**lightless caverns**).
- **Visual:** silhouette-forward; the mirrored tunnel as composition (two figures,
  opposite walls). Deep blacks, cold palette, bioluminescent accent color. Minimal UI.
- **Audio:** sparse cave ambience, drips, distant movement; sound telegraphs threats.
- [ ] Lock palette & reference board · animation feel

